    "name": "Teachable OAuth Videos API",
    "description": "OAuth 2.0-based API enabling third-party applications to authenticate on behalf of Teachable school owners. Provides access to current user profile, courses, lecture content, progress, and video assets using scoped OAuth tokens with token refresh and revocation support.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Teachable Support\n Email: support@teachable.com",
